class: negative
summary: a generic from result over a handle holding a pointer, copied out of an inout state, still views that state, so passing its other field inout while the result is used is refused, and a result from a type-formal source passed inout keeps its lock where the type holds no reference
expect: expected.txt
program: main.ldn
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/generic-from-pointer-handle-beside-inout/main.ldn
status: 1
codes: L0315, L0315
constructs: 0790, 0800, 0830, 1290, 1300
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, synthetic-32, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
